        "description": "A modern magazine-style WordPress theme designed for news, editorial, and blogging websites. Magazine Booster provides multiple layouts for featuring content, making it suitable for publishing news, reviews, guides, and opinion pieces. With a responsive design for consistent display across devices, the theme includes sections for featured content and recent posts, making it suitable for regularly updated sites with multiple categories. Support and documentation are available at https://wphoot.com/support/ and demo at https://demosites.wphoot.com/magazine-booster/."
